/Title (The need for an efficient fake news detection system has never been greater. Traditional methods of fact-checking are often slow and labor-intensive, making them inadequate to combat the sheer volume and speed at which misinformation spreads. This is where Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) plays a transformative role. AI-powered fake news detection systems can analyze vast amounts of data in real-time, identify patterns of deception, and distinguish between reliable content and false narratives using advanced machine learning algorithms and natural language processing \(NLP\).)
