/Title (return lb, ub  df = pd.read_csv\(TEXT_DATA\)  print\(df.shape\)  print\(df.head\(\)\)  df.drop\(labels=['id','title'], axis='columns', inplace=True\)  # only select stories with lengths gt 0 -- there are some texts with len = 0  mask = list\(df['text'].apply\(lambda x: len\(x\) > 0\)\)  df = df[mask]  texts = df['text']  labels = df['label'])
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1053 0 R
/Next 897 0 R
>>
endobj
